6 Experiments
In addition to the theoretical analysis, we perform extensive experiments across a range of settings to
validate the fairness as well as the efficiency of our proposed sketch. Consistent with the theoretical
guarantees established in previous sections, the experimental results confirm the effectiveness and
efficiency of our sketch in practical scenarios.
