9 Conclusion
In this paper we introduced FCM, a new frequency estimation framework that ensures equal
expected approximation factors across different groups, addressing a key fairness limitation of
traditional CM sketches. By proposing a fairness-preserving design—column partitioning with
group-aware hashing, our work offers strong theoretical guarantees and validates its effectiveness
through extensive experiments. Future research directions include extending FCM integrating
learned hash functions for further efficiency gains, and exploring fairness notions beyond group-
wise guarantees, such as individual fairness in streaming data sketches.
